[Music]  foreign  [Music]  management the U.S hedge fund best known  on Wall Street for its combative  approach to shaking up sleepy corporate  boards was never meant to become the  owner of a football club when it ended  up taking over AC Milan one of the most  storied teams in Italy about five years  ago it happened by accident  the hard-nosed investor had initially  decided to finance the audacious 2017  bid of a little-known Chinese  businessman Lee Yong Huang to buy AC  Milan from former Italian Prime Minister  Sylvia Berlusconi however Lee's  ownership proved brief as it defaulted  in 2018 giving Elliot control of the  club what Elliot took over was a fallen  star of European football AC Milan Was a  Serial winner of Europe's top tournament  in the 1990s and 2000s and won scores of  Italy's Syria titles during that period  thanks to the talent of the likes of  Marco rambasten George Weir Andrea Pirlo  and Paolo Maldini to name a few  but in the Years leading up to the  Takeover the club had stopped performing  on the pitch a failure that weighed on  its revenues when we took over it was a  totally disastrous situation one of  Elliot's top lieutenants confessed to  get the club back in shape it hired Ivan  gazidis from Arsenal as chief executive  with a mission to repair the club's  finances while moldini was promoted to  football director  with a goal to cut the squad's budget by  ditching big earners and bringing in  younger cheaper players  the only controversial exception to that  formula was bringing in Zlatan  Ibrahimovic one of the finest  Centerfolds of his generation  however the 40 year old was decisive in  igniting a Revival of the club's fortune  on and off the pitch  first bring the club back into the  Champions League at the end of the 2021  season and finally winning the Seria  title in 2022  the turnaround has allowed Elliot to  finally monetize its investment as it  agreed to sell the club for a record 1.2  billion euros to Jerry cardinales  private Equity Group Redbird  now it will be up to cardinalale to add  further major titles and take the club  to the next level  it will do so with the support of Elliot  which is partially financing the  acquisition and will retain board seats  at the club as well as providing key  assistance in either revamping the  club's historic stadium in sincero or  building a new one elsewhere  [Music]

